78 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (The Departmentof Electronics & Instrumentation Engineering was established in 2007-08, offering B.Tech degrees in Electronics & Instrumentation Engineering and Automation and Robotics, as well as M.Tech degrees in Electronics and Control and Automation and Robotics. The department's programs cater to the expanding needs of manufacturing and process industries. Faculty and students have filed over 100+ patents, with 75 granted and over 100 published. The department has secured Rs. 2 crores in funding from DST, SERB, SPARC, and NewGen IEDC. Accredited by IET and recognized by the IASC Sector Skill Council \(affiliated with the Ministry of Skill Development and Entrepreneurship, Govt. of India\), it also established a Center of Excellence in Factory Automation in collaboration with Mitsubishi Electric India Pvt. Ltd. and Center of Excelence in HMI in colaboration with Schneider Electric India Pvt. Ltd. )
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6 7]
>>
