/E (The National Level Automation & Robotics Challenge 2026, hosted by the Department of Electronics and Instrumentation Engineering at SRM Institute of Science and Technology, is organized by the SRM Automation Club. This event is designed to engage college students with the evolving landscape of Automation & Robotics, where the students will address pressing challenges and devise innovative solutions in our 4 Theme Realms. This provides a valuable exposure to real-world applications and emerging innovations, encouraging participants to deepen their knowledge and explore potential advancements in the AI-Driven World!)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
