/T (Automated Conveyor Sorting System: Design an automated conveyor system that uses sensors and a PLC or microcontroller to identify objects by size, colour, or material and sort them using pneumatic diverters or servo motors. PLC-based Automated Batch Process:  Design a PLC-based automated batch process for mixing, heating, and filling using sequential control, with level, flow, and temperature sensors for monitoring and an HMI for recipe management and operator interaction. Machine Vision Defect Detection System: Design a machine vision system using a camera with OpenCV or an industrial vision sensor, integrated with a PLC for accept/reject decisions and statistical quality reporting for process monitoring.)
